o her when did you last feel  free  when i got to drive my car a lot on  monday et was outside the los angeles  county courthouse with brittany's new  attorney  matthew rosengart who gave a brief  statement to media outlets and the  gathered crowd of britney fans  i once again want to thank britney  spears for her courage  and for her strength i also want to  thank britney spears fans and supporters  outreach and support for my firm myself  and most importantly brittany has truly  been overwhelming  finally and the last thing i'm going to  say about  this matter is as i said in court  last week and outside my firm and i are  moving  aggressively and expeditiously  to file a petition to remove jamie  spears  unless he resigns first thank you  you

